        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Use percentages instead of absolute units for view progress timeline …]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41171</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41171"/>
        <updated>2025-09-17T13:53:49.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44368997?u=f0a0c9f923d7c1e2159d23175cfb4e0e1bb0cbf6&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Bug description</h3>
<p dir="auto">The view progress scroll timeline example is broken on MDN playground because it uses absolute units (stumped me for quite a bit!). Here's a screenshot of how it looks like before my changes on Chrome v140:</p>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/44368997/490568499-3bea9592-436d-4d9b-9582-109d5b8c1317.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..uPNSmJd3B6yEsCIqIsybgbAR-CFx4LvM_jmHgv-2dro"><img width="460" height="315" alt="Screenshot before changes" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/44368997/490568499-3bea9592-436d-4d9b-9582-109d5b8c1317.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..uPNSmJd3B6yEsCIqIsybgbAR-CFx4LvM_jmHgv-2dro" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 315px;"></a>
<h3 dir="auto">Fix</h3>
<p dir="auto">I've updated the example to use percentage units instead of absolute units. Here's a screen recording with my fix:</p>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/44368997/490566885-64cfb7d5-d529-4936-a45d-31358010e0d3.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..YYaqB0j1SRpSxgcvxrKtbJB595Pyjb4foNLPy3WSV4U"><img width="460" height="315" alt="Screen recording with my changes" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/44368997/490566885-64cfb7d5-d529-4936-a45d-31358010e0d3.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..YYaqB0j1SRpSxgcvxrKtbJB595Pyjb4foNLPy3WSV4U" data-animated-image="" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 315px;"></a>]]></content>
